            <description><![CDATA[<h1>Pomace 1.1.0</h1>
<p>This is the last update you need to install by hand: Pomace now updates itself.</p>
<ul>
<li>Install Pomace by opening the disk image and dragging Pomace to Applications.</li>
<li>Pomace includes its compression tool, so Homebrew is no longer required.</li>
<li>The app and bundled compressor support Apple silicon and Intel Macs running macOS 14 or later.</li>
<li>Automatic update checks and Check for Updates are available in Pomace.</li>
<li>A custom compressor can still be selected in Advanced settings and is checked before each run.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
